{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA encoding with no image data or fusion, establishing a baseline for single-profile RNA modeling. Validation accuracy of 0.485 and F1 of 0.464 suggest moderate performance, but no comparative evidence exists to determine if this represents optimal RNA-only performance or potential for improvement. Uncertainty remains about the impact of multimodal components and alternative encoding strategies."
}

